<title>USA: RehabCare buys therapy company, assets.</title>
<headline>RehabCare buys therapy company, assets.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>RehabCare Group Inc said Thursday it acquired all the outstanding shares of Rehab Unlimited Inc and certain assets of Cimarron Health Care Inc.</p>
<p>Terms of the deals were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Both companies provide contract therapy services to long-term care facilities and home health agencies.</p>
<p>RehabCare provides therapist staffing services.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
